      "writtenOn": "2021-09-29T21:26:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doing +\u003d suspend_time_delta would be the same, since suspend_time_delta \u003d suspend_ns - vp-\u003einjected_suspend_ns; from the line before. \n\nEssentially suspend_ns and injected_suspend_ns are both accumulating over time, and when a config change occurs this function updates injected_suspend_ns to match suspend_ns and injects the change via timekeeping_inject_sleeptime64.",
